      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "ZIPPING FINNEGAN (5) has a strong winning strike-rate over this track and trip with two wins and a placing from five tries. Was out of the placings last time (29.95) at this track in a Grade 5, finishing fifth and beaten 5.5 lengths. Looks suited here and rates on top. SPARKLING WHEELS (2) was out of the placings last time but shapes well for this on her exceptional win a few runs back, getting around this track over 515m in 29.53. Expecting another bold showing. RAINBOW RAY (8) was unfancied latest when jumping from this same draw but belied the odds to place (23.03) over 400m at Maitland in a Grade 5. Solid beginner and with a good start should have clear running out wide. Harder here but will be in this for a long way. ",
